# Local Claude Code settings and tooling - machine specific, not part of the
# project. It was one file; a launch config and a static server for docs/ have
# since joined it, and none of it is the app, so the whole directory goes
# rather than naming them one at a time as they turn up.
.claude/

# Credentials and vendor API specs must never reach this repo - it is public,
# so anything committed here is downloadable by anyone, docs/ or not.
*.pdf

# Nothing holding a subscriber token, ever. The SAFPIS token lives in
# GitHub Actions secrets and reaches the runner as an environment variable.
.env
.env.*
*.token
